msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用指南"

msgid "ResourcePackServer hosts ``.zip`` resource pack files over HTTP. Minecraft clients can download packs via the ``resource-pack`` field in ``server.properties``."
msgstr "ResourcePackServer 通过 HTTP 托管 ``.zip`` 资源包文件。Minecraft 客户端可通过 ``server.properties`` 中的 ``resource-pack`` 字段下载资源包。"

msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

msgid "**1. Prepare your packs**"
msgstr "**1. 准备你的资源包**"

msgid "Place ``.zip`` resource pack files in a directory (default: ``./resource_packs``):"
msgstr "将 ``.zip`` 资源包文件放入一个目录（默认: ``./resource_packs``）："

msgid "**2. Start the server**"
msgstr "**2. 启动服务器**"

msgid "**3. Browse the pack list**"
msgstr "**3. 浏览资源包列表**"

msgid "Open ``http://localhost:8080/`` in a browser. You'll see a table of all packs with their SHA1 hashes."
msgstr "在浏览器中打开 ``http://localhost:8080/``。你会看到一个包含所有资源包及其 SHA1 哈希的表格。"

msgid "**4. Configure Minecraft**"
msgstr "**4. 配置 Minecraft**"

msgid "Edit ``server.properties``:"
msgstr "编辑 ``server.properties``："

msgid "The merged pack combines all your packs into one zip. See :doc:`/contents/config/index` for merge options."
msgstr "合并包将所有资源包合并为一个 zip 文件。合并选项参见 :doc:`/contents/config/index`。"

msgid "Standalone CLI Arguments"
msgstr "独立模式 CLI 参数"

msgid "Argument"
msgstr "参数"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

msgid "IP address to bind"
msgstr "绑定的 IP 地址"

msgid "Port to listen on"
msgstr "监听的端口"

msgid "Directory containing ``.zip`` packs"
msgstr "包含 ``.zip`` 资源包的目录"

msgid "Public URL prefix for external access"
msgstr "外部访问的公网 URL 前缀"

msgid "Enable/disable merged pack generation"
msgstr "启用/禁用合并包生成"

msgid "Pack filenames in merge priority order (highest first)"
msgstr "按合并优先级排序的资源包文件名（最高优先级在前）"

msgid "Enable debug logging"
msgstr "启用调试日志"

msgid "Show version and exit"
msgstr "显示版本并退出"

msgid "Merged Pack"
msgstr "合并包"

msgid "Minecraft only accepts **one** resource pack URL. ResourcePackServer solves this by merging multiple packs into a single ``merged.zip``, available at ``/merged.zip``."
msgstr "Minecraft 只接受**一个**资源包 URL。ResourcePackServer 通过将多个包合并为一个 ``merged.zip`` 来解决此问题，合并包位于 ``/merged.zip``。"

msgid "Packs are merged in **priority order** (configurable via ``--priority`` or the config file)"
msgstr "资源包按**优先级顺序**合并（可通过 ``--priority`` 或配置文件配置）"

msgid "Higher-priority packs **override** lower-priority ones on file-level"
msgstr "高优先级包会在文件级别**覆盖**低优先级包"

msgid "The ``pack.mcmeta`` description combines all pack descriptions"
msgstr "``pack.mcmeta`` 的描述字段会合并所有包的描述"

msgid "The ``pack.png`` icon is taken from the highest-priority pack that has one"
msgstr "``pack.png`` 图标取自具有该文件的最高优先级包"

msgid "The merged pack is **cached** and automatically regenerated when any source pack changes"
msgstr "合并包会被**缓存**，当任何源包更改时会自动重新生成"

msgid "Example with priority:"
msgstr "带优先级的示例："

msgid "HTTP Endpoints"
msgstr "HTTP 端点"

msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点"

msgid "HTML page listing all packs and the merged pack"
msgstr "列出所有资源包和合并包的 HTML 页面"

msgid "Download the merged resource pack"
msgstr "下载合并后的资源包"

msgid "Download an individual pack"
msgstr "下载单个资源包"

msgid "Each ``.zip`` response includes these headers:"
msgstr "每个 ``.zip`` 响应包含以下头："
